    "audioSha256": "8c9dd842316f38a5b06ebfa5c450fa193e910ca1597ad00e532fe5451eea30f4",
    "displayedText": "\"Did its brave run out?\" Pip asks Burrow.",
    "displayedTextSha256": "a71b5cc78d8e770e35213e0507e6ab58874f7ce1e49432ee25c74661de59d4c2",
