    "audioSha256": "f63149a0fb15a70fe96d5539b43a9392c2159a11bfcdd83c6b6eb1fc53f15714",
    "displayedText": "Glimmer cannot repeat the flare. Pip marks it as a supervised next step.",
    "displayedTextSha256": "e45d6ae9f86eb9274e0080d6d5a040da845f9587560beb630d2c3f0f18d41469",
